# Read by ripgrep (Claude Code's Grep/Glob tools) on top of .gitignore.
# public/ SVGs embed base64 images on 38-51k-character lines, so one search
# hit there can flood the context. List assets with `ls public/` instead, and
# use `rg --no-ignore` when you really need to search inside them.
public/
package-lock.json
